<section class="rv" id="avaliacoes"><div class="w"><div class="hdr"><h2 data-w style="margin:0">Quem passa pela Panda, recomenda.</h2>
<div class="big rvl"><b data-c="5" data-d="1">5,0</b><div><span class="st"><svg><use href="#s"/></svg><svg><use href="#s"/></svg><svg><use href="#s"/></svg><svg><use href="#s"/></svg><svg><use href="#s"/></svg></span><br><small style="color:var(--mute)">26 avaliações no Google</small></div></div></div>
